      "writtenOn": "2024-06-28T23:50:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n  private void addSingleClassBindModule(List\u003cModule\u003e modules, @Nullable Class\u003c?\u003e clazz) {\n    if (clazz !\u003d null) {\n      modules.add(new AbstractModule() {\n        @Override\n        protected void configure() {\n          bind(clazz);\n        }\n      });\n    }\n  }\n```",
      "revId": "23c42149e9497c6d70be2b0504f53cad10f3fc21",
