      "message": "This is effectively unneeded for two reasons:\n1. We haven\u0027t demonstrated with tests that it is actually needed: if you comment out this line, all the tests are still passing\n2. We do not currently support or have any evidence that ApiModule actually works with batch programs, therefore there will be no hierarchy there",
