      "message": "You can dry-out all the `try() {}` in all tests and leave the automatic closure of the TestServerPlugin to the `@After` annotation.\n\nIt would allow to avoid all the distractions to the reader of the test.\n\n```suggestion\n  private AutoCloseable autoClosePlugin;\n\n  @After\n  public void tearDown() throws Exception {\n    if(autoClosePlugin !\u003d null) {\n      autoClosePlugin.close();\n    }\n  }\n```",
